ADDENDA <Act No. 6137, Jan. 12, 2000>
Article 1 (Enforcement date)
This Act shall enter into force 2 months after the date of its promulgation.
Article 2 (Transitional measures)
(1) The FBC shall amend its articles of incorporation and obtain approval from the KCC within 3 months after the enforcement of this Act.
(2) The executive officers and the secretary general under this Act shall be appointed in accordance with this Act within 3 months after this Act enters into force.
(3) The chairperson, directors, auditors, and secretary general in office at the time of enforcement of this Act shall perform their duties until their successors are appointed in accordance with this Act.

